cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Skarstrom in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Skarstrom: pressure and temperature swing adsorption cycle simulator"
abstract: >-
  Skarstrom simulates pressure, vacuum and temperature swing adsorption
  (PSA/VSA/TSA) cycles. Its C++20 engine (adsim) solves a 1D packed-bed model
  with SUNDIALS IDA to cyclic steady state; a Python package and command-line
  tool wrap it.
authors:
  - family-names: Affleck
    given-names: Sam
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
# Licence: keep in step with LICENSE, NOTICE, README.md and pyproject.toml.
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://samaffleck.github.io/skarstrom/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/samaffleck/skarstrom"
keywords:
  - adsorption
  - pressure swing adsorption
  - temperature swing adsorption
  - process simulation
  - gas separation
